{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全公演無事終了しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ayane.suzuki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/ayane.suzuki/img/2015/09/07/1715996/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明治神宮球場2days"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日目は生憎の雨でしたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日目は途中から天気も味方してくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨のライブは初めてでしたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事怪我なくメンバー全員でツアーを終えることができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ開催が発表されました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月15日～10月25日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AiiA 2.5 Theater Tokyo"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月17日・12月18日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本武道館"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4thシーズンは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12thアンダーメンバーで行います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"im